<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-RESULT IN THE SPANISH CUP THIRD ROUND.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULT IN THE SPANISH CUP THIRD ROUND.</headline>
<dateline>ALICANTE, Spain 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a Spanish Cup third round, second leg match on Wednesday (game postponed from last week because of bad weather):</p>
<p> Hercules	2   Lleida (II)	 1</p>
<p>(2-2 on aggregate, Lleida win on away goals rule).</p>
